  data: {
    LLM: "Focus on meeting the contract requirement first. Hold wild cards for flexibility. Watch what cards opponents are collecting.\n\nPlan ahead for upcoming contracts. Use the 'push' mechanic strategically - forcing cards on opponents can disrupt their plans. Replace wild cards when beneficial to free them for other melds.\n\nTrack discards and pushes to deduce opponent hands. Time your go-out to maximize opponent penalties. In gambling version, manage risk based on pot size and your position. Round 5's run of 7 is difficult - prepare early.",
